{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. The triangle is folded along <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> so that vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> now rests at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" /> on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/7/1e7763193381b56a04e4c6c02818df7489eb6b34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA&#39;=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4fb4a802b710cdb7a0c2ffefeadef3303a0dbfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;C=2$\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" /> then the length of the crease <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d2ce729a34d87af009c00ae80e9579aa6cbfd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{8}{5}  \\text{(B) } \\frac{7}{20}\\sqrt{21} \\text{(C) } \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\text{(D) } \\frac{13}{8} \\text{(E) } \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"327\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca198a6c132487ae8269bd2705b0a33de285465e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP=A&#39;P=x$\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f936e5a650d3ff1479dc3f3fcf438d9c1fdc3aba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ=A&#39;Q=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907f3a4d79c452f0bc3ebac9d2554318a243197d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP=3-x$\" width=\"94\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b689e879157b13954044abfe7721fb9963d30814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ=3-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />. Applying Law of Cosines on triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/850c0ce156f572e8db45195d4312522a03afafcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BPA&#39;$\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d6289ace11bb97daa0c36b006d3503cb777a1834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQA&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> using the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> angles gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee707625706932c7da01fe7658bb293afd1909e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{7}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a21ae17e33abcf04950bf5d890809975f53de8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />. Applying Law of Cosines once again on triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/0/880518fa90ebed1440cedcc1a86d052a01c4b434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$APQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> using the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> angle gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/e/e1e78af13b9fd1648966e93fffbf619501de8e97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[PQ^2=\\frac{(21)(49)}{400}\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"39\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bfda0fe917934bce76114ed611c4c0efc45bdc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[PQ=\\frac{7}{20}\\sqrt{21}\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" /> The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a898938f2ec099c5fb5a26779173d69297610752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh\">https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh</a>\n</p><p>~ TheSkibidiSigma9\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi